[D]Ho aaj kal [G]tanhaa main kahaan hoon, [A]sath chaltaa [D]koi

[D]Uski hamen [G]aadat hone ki [A]aadat ho [D]gayi

[D]Wo jo mila hai [G]jab se uski [A]saubat ho [D]gayi

[D]ik zara [G]masum se dil ki [A]afat ho gai

[D]Sun le [Bm]zara, [D]sun le [Bm]zara

[D]Dil ne [G]kahaa, [A]itnaa bas [D]mujhe pata hai

[D]I am in [Bm]love, [D]I am in [Bm]love

[D]Tu hi [G]bata [A]jane kya [D]mujhe hua hai

Ose [D]bundhon mein tu hai,

Aankhein [Bm]mundo mein tu hai

Dishayo [G]das tu hai, tu hi hai [A]bas tu hai

Dil ka [D]sheher tu hai, acchi [Bm]khabar tu hai

Fursat ki [G]hansi tu hai, jo bhi thi [A]kami tu hai

[D]Tu hai [Bm]mera, [D]tu hai [Bm]mera

[D]Kuch main janu [G]na, [A]itna bas [D]mujhe pata hai

[D]I am in [Bm]love, [D]I am in [Bm]love

[D]Tu hi [G]bata [A]jane kya [D]mujhe hua hai

Baadal pe [D]chaltaa hoon main, girtaa [Bm]sambhltaa hoon main

Khwaishen [G]karta hoon main, khone se [A]darta hoon main

Jaga na [D]soya hoon main, musafir [Bm]khoyaa hoon main

Kuch sarfi [G]ra sa hoon main, budhu [A]zara sa hoon main

[D]Dil kya [Bm]kare, [D]dil kya [Bm]kare

[D]Tere [G]bina, [A]itna bas [D]mujhe pata hai

[D]I am in [Bm]love, [D]I am in [Bm]love

[D]Tu hi [G]bataa [A]jaane kya [G]mujhe hua hai
